{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, נְגַד","hw":"נְגַד","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נְגַד</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. stream, flow (</strong>𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">נְגַד</span>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܓܰܕ</span> <em>draw along, lead</em>, 𝔗 also intrans. <em>move along</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.24\">Is 30:24</a>, <em>flow</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.13\">Dt 33:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.22\">22</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נַגְדִּין</span> <em>streams</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.4\">Is 44:4</a> +<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pt. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:10\" href=\"/Daniel.7.10\">Dn 7:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">נְהַר דִּי נוּר נָגֵד וְנָפֵק מִן־קֳדָמוֹהִי</span>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, נֶ֫גֶד","prev":"BDB Aramaic, נֶבְרַשְׁתָּא"}